## 2. Control Selection

The following controls were selected based on common telecom security risks:

| Security Control | Main Purpose | Risk Addressed |
|---|---|---|
| Access Control | Restrict unauthorized access | Unauthorized access |
| Multi-Factor Authentication | Strengthen user authentication | Account compromise |
| Encryption | Protect sensitive data | Data leakage |
| Firewall | Control network traffic | Unauthorized network access |
| IDS/IPS | Detect and prevent attacks | Network attacks |
